etech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-strategy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing strategy<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>AI-driven tools can process massive amounts of data within seconds to determine patterns and make predictions without human intervention. Also, they can forecast <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/top-latest-digital-marketing-trends\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">marketing trends<\/a>, give meaningful insights into complex data, offer personalized recommendations, automate repetitive tasks, and make marketing efforts more impactful.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Below, we have explained a few ways in which we can use artificial intelligence tools for digital marketing in day-to-day tasks.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Predictive lead scoring<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content optimization<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sentiment analysis<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customer-facing bots<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ad targeting and enhancement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brand alignment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Translation of multilingual campaigns<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Market research<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-government-jobs\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">10 Government Jobs in Digital Marketing in India<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>List of AI Tools for Digital Marketing<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The points mentioned above are just the tip of the iceberg. AI is a new normal, and most apps and software we use have built-in AI features. Here are highly recommended AI tools to use in digital marketing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Jasper.ai<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Zapier<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Grammarly<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brand24<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trellis<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Seventh Sense<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>ChatFuel<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Phrasee<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Copy.ai<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>MarketMuse<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>ChatGPT<\/l