     <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n                                        View Brochure\n                                    <\/a>\n                                \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Best AI Tools for Digital Marketing<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Let\u2019s talk about these digital marketing artificial intelligence tools in detail:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Jasper.ai<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"151\" height=\"35\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/jasper.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6992\" style=\"width:371px;height:86px\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Earlier known as Conversion.ai, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jasper.ai\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Jasper<\/a> is an AI content creation tool designed to create engaging content for blogs, social media, and other platforms. It supports 30 languages and can browse the internet within seconds to seek real-time information.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Equipped with SEO optimization features, 50+ industry-specific templates, and a context-aware writing assistant, Jasper is among the most sought-after AI tools for digital marketers who use it to streamline the process of creating engaging content right from ideation to publication.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use this advanced tool to create top-quality emails, articles, landing pages, ad copies, and social media posts. Also, it uses the GPT3 model designed by OpenAI to compose content that doesn\u2019t look like it was created by a machine. You simply need to add your product or brand name, and it will automatically generate a copy for you.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It seamlessly integrates with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a> and CMS tools like Surfer SEO and Webflow to create content. Moreover, brands that are struggling to maintain a consistent voice across all platforms can utilize this tool for customization.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You simply need to feed your brand details, guidelines, and company information, and it will create content that suits your brand\u2019s style and narrative. E-commerce businesses can use Jasper to write product descriptions, bullet points, meta titles, and other forms of content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Features of Jasper AI Marketing Tool<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tone adjustment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable templates<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Browses the internet to find fresh data<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supports multiple languages<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>50+ built-in templates<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plagiarism checker<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A chat feature and do-it-yourself features<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Backed by machine learning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Allows multiple teams to collaborate<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Beginner-friendly&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Zapier<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"222\" height=\"61\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/zapier-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6994\" style=\"width:280px;height:77px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/zapier-1.webp 222w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/zapier-1-150x41.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 222px) 100vw, 222px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.googleadservices.com\/pagead\/aclk?sa=L&amp;ai=DChcSEwj7u8qD8L6EAxURqGYCHSFACx4YABAAGgJzbQ&amp;ase=2&amp;gclid=CjwKCAiA_tuuBhAUEiwAvxkgThBuuCzpimfUPDniNGVf1lqHRldaB82oYMorlnLOYQKy-wfc30Z67xoCjT0QAvD_BwE&amp;ohost=www.google.com&amp;cid=CAESV-D2DdoIY_MZ08-6xtKLJT-NfZk660-J6cBbQBWluuF3Lp3WdyXNc1LiuJNARUDYnlNGTGWtLOGyPbT3FsfTOAucJsDjbOimESRxYVdeMexvHmpePmfa_w&amp;sig=AOD64_0qptKSEM23V6zMjUM5XHuhx2XZLg&amp;q&amp;nis=4&amp;adurl&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiO8cSD8L6EAxXSTmwGHVB4BV0Q0Qx6BAgFEAE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Zapier<\/a> is one of the top AI tools for marketing used to scale businesses by automating time-intensive tasks. This workflow automation platform can connect more than 3000 apps and automate repetitive tasks so marketers can focus on other productive tasks. It is equipped with an AI chatbot that allows users to create AI-powered chatbots using its interface.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are various chatbot use cases, such as a press release generator, jargon translator, risk assessment bot, etc. The tool can also turn text-based input from Slack messages, emails, Tweets, and forms into useful data and answer simple questions. It is also easy to train the chatbot on specific documents, so it can act as an interactive knowledge base.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It also offers multiple templates, such as an Explain bot to break down complex concepts, a Business Coach bot to offer business advice and a ZapChat bot.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Features of Zapier AI Marketing Tool<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Automates repetitive tasks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A cloud-based tool accessible from any device<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Triggers and actions to automate workflows<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>User-friendly interface<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Integrates with over 3,000 apps<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Numerous customization options<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Grammarly<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/grammarly-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6998\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/grammarly-1.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/grammarly-1-150x84.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.grammarly.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Grammarly<\/a> is a popular content marketing tool used by most content writers and editors. Businesses and marketers rely on this AI-powered platform to proofread and evaluate the quality of their content before publishing it.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The tool analyzes content meticulously based on different factors and highlights sentences and words that can be improved. It doesn\u2019t make assumptions but ensures that the content looks polished and professional by focusing on grammar, sentence formation, and syntax rules.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can integrate Grammarly with different apps, so you can use it while working with Twitter, Facebook, Gmail, and other digital channels. The AI highlights errors and suggests changes that users can either accept or ignore. Apart from checking grammar and punctuation, it also spots inconsistencies, redundant words, and incomplete sentences and suggests alternatives.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can install Grammarly as an extension for Google Chrome and use it for more powerful functions, such as checking clarity, tone, and style.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Features of Grammarly AI Marketing Tool<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Real-time feedback<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plagiarism checker<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Free and paid versions for different uses<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tone adjustments<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Works with Quora, Google Documents, Slack, and other channels<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Brand24<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/brand24-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6999\" style=\"width:229px;height:48px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/brand24-1.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/brand24-1-96x21.webp 96w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Customers want quick replies and solutions to their queries in the fast-moving digital world. Brands always have to be on their toes while handling social media profiles and users, or else they might miss out on their valuable customers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>However, the issue is when a business is present across all major <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/social-media-platforms\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">social media platforms<\/a>. In such a situation, keeping track of each mention, comment, query, feedback, and topic can be tricky.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Fortunately, you have one of the best AI tools for digital marketing to help you. You can use this tool to know whenever your brand is mentioned on any platform. <a href=\"https:\/\/brand24.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brand24<\/a> keeps an eye on social media, videos, news sites, blogs, forums, and other channels to find all the mentions and then uses sentiment analysis to find conversation topics and emotions of users.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Basically, the tool scours conversations for your social media teams and community management. This allows you to respond to customers\u2019 reviews, feedback, and criticism in a timely manner while offering the support they need.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This improves customer relationships, experience, and retention rates. You can handle crises before they become serious and address any problem with a positive approach.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It also has a hashtag trend-spotting feature that enhances your marketing strategy and ensures you build stronger relationships with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Features of Brand24 AI Digital Marketing Tool<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Data exporting<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real-time notifications when the brand name is mentioned&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social measurement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitors mentions across all platforms<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Discussion volume chart<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Finds influencers talking about your brand<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sentiment scoring and analysis behind each brand mention<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read<\/strong>: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-tips\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Tips: Expert Advice for Beginners<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Trellis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"625\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/trellis-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7000\" style=\"width:179px;height:112px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/trellis-1.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/trellis-1-300x188.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/trellis-1-768x480.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/trellis-1-150x94.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.trellisdata.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Trellis<\/a> is a robust e-commerce marketing tool powered by artificial intelligence to optimize ad campaigns. It analyzes performance data from different ad platforms, determines trends, and updates campaigns accordingly.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The most prominent feature that makes it among the leading AI digital marketing tools is its dynamic Pricing Module, which uses AI to test an array of product prices to find the best pricing strategy.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It adjusts prices according to predefined criteria, such as profit margins, market conditions, and sales volume. The tool ensures that sellers earn maximum profits while offering competitive prices daily. It also considers low inventory so that sellers don\u2019t have to face stock shortages.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Trellis regularly updates bids on high-impact keywords for ads, which enables it to capitalize on cross-campaign data. It weaves different contexts, including seasons and ad creativity, which helps sellers make informed and profit-driven decisions while launching ad campaigns.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The tool makes predicting ROI for ads simple with the Promotions Module. Now, sellers can easily anticipate ROI on campaigns by using historical data and previous ad campaigns. Trellis focuses on automation, which makes it a top choice a